<title>MEXICO: RESEARCH ALERT-Tamsa started as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Tamsa started as buy.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Afin Securities International said Wednesday it had started coverage of Mexican steel pipe producer Tubos de Acero de Mexico SA (TAMSA) with a buy recommendation.</p>
<p>Analyst Sumant Vasal said the company should benefit from state oil company Pemex's investment plans for 1997 as well as greater penetration in the global oil country tubular goods market.</p>
<p>He said the company plans capacity expansion and has recently reduced its debt.</p>
<p>Tamsa was off 10 centavos to 130.30 pesos in early trade on the Mexican Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>((--David Luhnow, Mexico City Newsroom 525 728-9565))</p>
